:: Widgets HonestMarkets[widget]
<<widget "HonestMarkets_Intro">>
    <<honestMarketsBegin>>
    <<honestMarketsEncounterDebugControls>>
    <<if setup.HonestMarkets.isBannedToday()>>
        <span class="grey"><<print setup.HonestMarkets.marketBanText()>></span><br><br>
    <<elseif setup.HonestMarkets.isMarketOpen()>>
        你走在各色攤位之間，琳瑯滿目的商品令人眼花撩亂。周圍人頭攢動，叫賣聲不絕於耳。<br>
        要是沒有目標，你恐怕連逛三天三夜也難買到心儀的商品。<br><br>
        你要重點關注哪方面的商品？
        <br><br>
        <<link [[購買商品|HonestMarkets Products]]>><<run setup.HonestMarkets.prepareMarketEncounter("HonestMarkets Products", "products")>><</link>><br>
        <<link [[購買種子和肥料|HonestMarkets Seeds]]>><<run setup.HonestMarkets.prepareMarketEncounter("HonestMarkets Seeds", "seeds")>><</link>><br>
        <<link [[購買服裝|HonestMarkets Clothing]]>><<run setup.HonestMarkets.prepareMarketEncounter("HonestMarkets Clothing", "clothing")>><</link>><br>
        <<link [[只是閒逛|HonestMarkets Walk]]>><<run setup.HonestMarkets.endVisit()>><</link>><br><br>
    <<else>>
        <span class="grey"><<print setup.HonestMarkets.marketClosedText()>></span><br><br>
    <</if>>
        <<getouticon>><<link [[離開|Connudatus Street]]>><<run setup.HonestMarkets.endVisit()>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</widget>>

:: HonestMarkets Products[]
<<honestMarketsEncounterDebugControls>>
<<if setup.HonestMarkets.isBannedToday()>>
    <span class="grey"><<print setup.HonestMarkets.marketBanText()>></span>
<<elseif setup.HonestMarkets.isMarketOpen()>>
    市場裡擠滿了大大小小的攤位。攤販們高聲招呼著來往的客人，貨箱與籃筐一路堆到腳邊，各式商品混雜其中。有人正為幾便士討價還價，也有人乾脆抱走整箱貨物。
    每個攤位的價格和存貨都不太一樣，買得多些通常比較容易談到好價錢。至於那些寫在紙板上的價格究竟有多划算，就得靠你自己判斷了。<br><br>
    你打算先逛逛哪一類商品？<br><br>
    <<honestMarketsCategories>>
    <br>
<<if setup.HonestMarkets.canExploreMore()>>
	<<link "探索更多商品 (00:30)" "HonestMarkets Products">><<pass 30>><<run setup.HonestMarkets.refreshProductOffers()>><<run setup.HonestMarkets.prepareMarketEncounter("HonestMarkets Products", "refresh")>><</link>><br>
	<span class="grey">你可以花些時間繼續逛逛，說不定會有新的發現。</span>
<<else>>
	<span class="grey">時間已經不早了，攤販們陸續開始收拾，已經沒有時間再仔細探索市場了。</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<honestMarketsOrphanage>>
<<honestMarketsOrphanageDebug>>
<<else>>
    <span class="grey"><<print setup.HonestMarkets.marketClosedText()>></span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回市場入口|Connudatus Markets]]>><</link>><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[離開|Connudatus Street]]>><<run setup.HonestMarkets.endVisit()>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: HonestMarkets Orphanage[]
<<if !setup.HonestMarkets.canShowOrphanageOrder()>>
    <span class="grey">剛才看到的採購機會已經不合適了。</span><br><br>
    <<link [[返回商品市場|HonestMarkets Products]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
    市集裡堆著今天剛送來的食材。你想到孤兒院總是需要更多食物，也許可以趁現在替他們添上一些。<br><br>
    你挑了幾樣價格和供貨都還算合適的東西，攤販可以直接替你整理好，再送往孤兒院。<br><br>
    <<honestMarketsOrphanageList>>
    <br><br>
    <<set _orphanageOrder to setup.HonestMarkets.getOrphanageOrder()>>
    <<set _orphanageLabel to "購買這些食物送往孤兒院（" + setup.HonestMarkets.moneyText(_orphanageOrder.total) + "）(00:15)">>
    <<link _orphanageLabel "HonestMarkets Orphanage Result">><</link>><br>
    <<link [[還是算了|HonestMarkets Products]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: HonestMarkets Orphanage Result[]
<<set _orphanagePaid to setup.HonestMarkets.purchaseOrphanageOrder()>>
<<if _orphanagePaid>>
    你和攤販確認好要送往孤兒院的食材。幾個袋子和箱子很快被整理出來，攤販答應稍後替你送過去。<br><br>
    至少今天，他們能吃得好一些。<br><br>
    <<link [[繼續逛市集|HonestMarkets Products]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
    <span class="grey">情況已經改變，你現在沒辦法完成這筆採購。</span><br><br>
    <<link [[返回商品市場|HonestMarkets Products]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

